{"id":"bc3b74121029112d","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-entropy.md","title":"Kolmogorov Entropy","display":"df-entropy — Kolmogorov Entropy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-entropy","aliases":["58-df-entropy"],"display":"df-entropy — Kolmogorov Entropy","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-entropy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-entropy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-entropy — Kolmogorov Entropy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span>（概率空间）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>（测度谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(\\alpha\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span>（有限可测划分）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（此处定义的谓词）</li>\n<li>约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\log0\\coloneqq0\">\\(0\\log0\\coloneqq0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:V^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(H:V^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>，写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\mu(\\alpha)\">\\(H_\\mu(\\alpha)\\)</span>（划分的 Shannon–Kolmogorov 熵算子）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition}\\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in[\\mathcal F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\alpha\\land\\bigcup\\alpha=X\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\alpha\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition}\\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in[\\mathcal F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\alpha\\land\\bigcup\\alpha=X\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\alpha\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}entropy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\to H_\\mu(\\alpha)\\coloneqq-\\sum_{A\\in\\alpha}\\mu(A)\\log\\mu(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}entropy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\to H_\\mu(\\alpha)\\coloneqq-\\sum_{A\\in\\alpha}\\mu(A)\\log\\mu(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>熵依赖具体概率测度，故记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\mu(\\alpha)\">\\(H_\\mu(\\alpha)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限可测划分不同于基数分划关系，原来的 <code>58-df-partition</code> 依赖属于错误语境。</li>\n<li>动力系统的 Kolmogorov–Sinai 熵还需对迭代细化取极限与上确界，本原子只定义单个划分的熵。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)$（测度谓词，见 [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"0\\log0\\coloneqq0","display":false},{"tex":"H:V^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\mu(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition}\\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in[\\mathcal F]^{<\\omega}\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\alpha\\land\\bigcup\\alpha=X\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\alpha\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\varnothing)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}entropy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\to H_\\mu(\\alpha)\\coloneqq-\\sum_{A\\in\\alpha}\\mu(A)\\log\\mu(A)","display":true},{"tex":"H_\\mu(\\alpha)","display":false}],"bytes":1508,"backlinks":[{"id":"63308cd051c46e93","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"847fd99f748e318f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$h$ (conditional entropy value, see [[58-df-entropy]])"},{"id":"e1275c40f030ae92","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03be65ef075305b0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H_\\mu$ is the partition-entropy operator from [[58-df-entropy]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-482","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-entropy.md|58-df-entropy]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728"]}